The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a>, &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max, and foldable "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/iphone-ultra/">iPhone Ultra</a>" could be in short supply this year, leading to long wait times and an initial sellout during preorders.<br/>
<br/>
